  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Apps\n* Bump `net_conduit_tcp` from `2.0.1` to `2.1.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_tcp/2.0.1...net_conduit_tcp/2.1.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_websocket` from `2.0.1` to `2.1.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_websocket/2.0.1...net_conduit_websocket/2.1.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_udp` from `2.0.1` to `2.1.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_udp/2.0.1...net_conduit_udp/2.1.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_ipc` from `2.0.1` to `2.1.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_ipc/2.0.1...net_conduit_ipc/2.1.0)\n* Bump `net_conduit_quic` from `2.0.1` to `2.1.0`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/net_conduit_quic/2.0.1...net_conduit_quic/2.1.0)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 9.0.0 to 9.0.15 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/48\n* Bump NuGet.Packaging from 6.12.1 to 6.12.5 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/49\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.13 to 9.0.14 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/51\n* Bump System.IO.Pipelines from 10.0.5 to 10.0.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/52\n* Bump System.Security.Cryptography.Xml from 9.0.15 to 10.0.6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/pull/53\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/NetConduit/compare/build.20260414105734.8c12a5d...build.20260422055737.4b2af35",
